ekly installment of Icaria's misadventures... well, you're probably going to die in agony. But, if you'd be willing to settle for fantastic adventures in a setting calibrated pretty much precisely to his wishes, you may want to check out <a href=\"http://nobilis.me/perturbation-in-palanquin\" target=\"_blank\">Perturbation in Palanquin</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/134196/Chuubos-Marvelous-WishGranting-Engine\" target=\"_blank\">Chuubo's Marvelous Wish-Granting Engine RPG</a> \u2014 <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/JennaMoran\" target=\"_blank\">Jenna Moran's Patreon</a> \u2014 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/215-rand-brittain","name":"Rand Brittain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-11T02:54:30-08:00","id":1175130,"title":"","content":"So, is this place meant to be where we talk about PiP? Because daaaaaaaaaaamn that Tittyderal... Rulebook when? :-p","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3657-sagara","name":"Sagara","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3657_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-11T13:48:38-08:00","id":1175269,"title":"","content":"One thing I'm finding weird about this is the apparently mortal combatants using what appears to be Charms. For instance, Boss-fight-minion Lohas in the second session:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>Rand:</b> Lohas is going last. He's hurt bad, but it only increases his focus.<br /> <b>Tamira:</b> He's gonna fight to the death, eh?<br /> <b>Rand:</b> He uses the Even Blade mastery ability to spend a Willpower and turn his penalties into bonuses until his next turn </div> </div> </div>I got the impression Lohas was a mortal, yet he is using a Charm here? And a <b>mastery </b>effect no less?! Or is that a mastery effect that Seven Skies has that benefits Lohas?<br /> <br /> What about Monkey-boy Hau from the first session?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>Rand Brittain:</b> That crashes him.<br /> <b>Rand Brittain:</b> Although in some ways that only makes him more annoying.<br /> <b>Rand Brittain:</b> He falls backwards into the struggling monkey stance made popular by Jackie Chan.<br /> <b>Rand Brittain:</b> This boosts his Evasion to 6. </div> </div> </div>I also got the impression all the Great Animal people in that fight were Mortals, but Hau is clearly using some sort of mechanically-significant-widget here. Is he a mortal? Is that a Charm or what?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"user